# Vulnerabilities accepted on purpose, one per line, each with a reason and a
# review date. CI already skips CVEs with no fixed version (--ignore-unfixed),
# so anything here is a fixable HIGH/CRITICAL that we've decided to live with
# for now. Keep this list empty whenever possible.
#
# Format:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # why it doesn't apply / why it's acceptable; review by YYYY-MM-DD
